WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:07.203
Rat and Mole waved at ducks from the riverbank.

2
00:00:07.204 --> 00:00:11.581
"Rowing and swimming are great fun," Mole said.

3
00:00:11.582 --> 00:00:15.224
Mole felt like an expert now.

4
00:00:15.225 --> 00:00:20.071
"Here is a poem for the ducks!" said Rat.

5
00:00:20.072 --> 00:00:23.931
Ducks can swim on the river,

6
00:00:23.932 --> 00:00:27.825
Ducks can swim on the sea,

7
00:00:27.826 --> 00:00:32.121
Ducks can swim most anywhere,

8
00:00:32.122 --> 00:00:37.836
But not in an apple tree.

9
00:00:37.837 --> 00:00:43.437
"I don’t like your poem much," said Mole, smiling.

10
00:00:43.438 --> 00:00:49.576
The ducks stuck their heads under the water.

11
00:00:49.577 --> 00:00:54.585
"The ducks don’t either!" laughed Rat.

12
00:00:54.586 --> 00:00:58.023
"I was wondering," said Mole.

13
00:00:58.024 --> 00:01:00.582
"Could I meet Toad?"

14
00:01:00.583 --> 00:01:04.067
"What a great idea!" Rat said.

15
00:01:04.068 --> 00:01:08.041
"We’ll paddle right there!"

16
00:01:08.042 --> 00:01:11.077
Mole untied the boat.

17
00:01:11.078 --> 00:01:15.362
Rat rowed them down the river.

18
00:01:15.363 --> 00:01:20.227
"Toad must be very nice," said Mole.

19
00:01:20.228 --> 00:01:24.240
"He is very friendly," said Rat.

20
00:01:24.241 --> 00:01:27.358
"But not too clever."

21
00:01:27.359 --> 00:01:31.255
"Not everybody is clever," said Mole.

22
00:01:31.256 --> 00:01:33.480
"Yes," agreed Rat.

23
00:01:33.481 --> 00:01:41.661
"But Toad, well . . . he thinks he is more clever than he is."

24
00:01:41.662 --> 00:01:46.396
The river curved as they rowed along.

25
00:01:46.397 --> 00:01:50.687
Suddenly a grand house came into sight.

26
00:01:50.688 --> 00:01:54.170
"There’s Toad Hall!" said Rat.

27
00:01:54.171 --> 00:01:57.955
Rat rowed the boat to shore.

28
00:01:57.956 --> 00:02:02.052
They climbed out and walked to the house.

29
00:02:02.053 --> 00:02:06.503
Many boats were piled up on the grass.

30
00:02:06.504 --> 00:02:09.175
"Oh no," Rat said.

31
00:02:09.176 --> 00:02:11.994
"Toad is finished with boating.

32
00:02:11.995 --> 00:02:19.308
I wonder what he is up to now."

